cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on PriorLock, please cite it as below."
title: "PriorLock: Do Coding Agents Read the Documentation, or Code from Memory?"
abstract: >-
  An RL environment, benchmark and hardened verifier that measure whether
  coding agents act on the installed library's documentation when it
  contradicts what they memorized. Includes an isolated call-observing grader,
  offline integrity gates, a cheat battery, per-seed synthetic tasks,
  non-destructive wrapping of Harbor tasks, and a four-condition model
  benchmark.
type: software
